From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:35:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0097/3799] soh: rename D_8012AFB0 -> sTransUnkBackgroundDL

Name source: deduced from the code (confidence HIGH).
Defined in soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c b/soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c
index 4930ddfb4..e1e7dc5b3 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_fbdemo.c
@@ -1,7 +1,10 @@
 #include "global.h"
 #include <string.h>
 
-Gfx D_8012AFB0[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8012AFB0: Gfx display list for the transition background (blue rect);
+// defined but unreferenced. (oot names this subsystem's equivalent sTransTileBackgroundDL — SoH keeps the
+// TransitionUnk prefix: https://github.com/zeldaret/oot/blob/main/src/code/z_fbdemo.c)
+Gfx sTransUnkBackgroundDL[] = {
     gsDPPipeSync(),
     gsDPSetCycleType(G_CYC_FILL),
     gsDPSetColorImage(G_IM_FMT_RGBA, G_IM_SIZ_16b, 320, 0x0F000000),
-- 
2.55.0

